}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get Capacity Building Evaluation Detail
  
  Retrieves the complete detail of a single capacity building programme evaluation by its unique identifier. Returns all programme details, sponsorship information, participant metrics, logistics ratings, challenges, financial summary, and evaluator information.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the capacity building evaluation record      |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete capacity building evaluation record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  The result is cached under the key `cedarrise:capacity:evaluation:<id>` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                          | Type   | Description                                                       |
  |--------------------------------|--------|-------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                             | string | UUID primary key.                                                 |
  | programName                    | string | Name of the programme.                                            |
  | programType                    | string | Type of programme.                                                |
  | programDate                    | string | Date of the programme (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                             |
  | location                       | string | Programme location.                                               |
  | programCoordinator             | string | Name of the programme coordinator.                                |
  | numberOfSponsors               | number | Number of sponsors.                                               |
  | listOfSponsors                 | string | Names of sponsors.                                                |
  | sponsorshipType                | string | Type of sponsorship.                                              |
  | partnerOrganizations           | string | Partner organizations (nullable).                                 |
  | partnershipLevel               | string | Level of partnership.                                             |
  | numberOfParticipants           | number | Number of participants.                                           |
  | targetAudience                 | string | Target audience for the programme.                                |
  | numberOfFacilitators           | number | Number of facilitators.                                           |
  | numberOfVolunteers             | number | Number of volunteers.                                             |
  | participantEngagementLevel     | string | Level of participant engagement.                                  |
  | programObjectives              | string | Programme objectives (nullable).                                  |
  | objectiveAchievement           | string | Whether objectives were achieved.                                 |
  | programOutcome                 | string | Programme outcome (nullable).                                     |
  | programImpact                  | string | Programme impact description (nullable).                          |
  | majorActivities                | string | Major activities conducted (nullable).                            |
  | effectiveActivities            | string | Most effective activities (nullable).                             |
  | venueSuitability               | number | Venue suitability rating (1–5).                                   |
  | timeManagement                 | number | Time management rating (1–5).                                     |
  | resourceAvailability           | number | Resource availability rating (1–5).                               |
  | communicationAndCoordination   | number | Communication and coordination rating (1–5).                      |
  | teamworkAmongOrganizers        | number | Teamwork among organizers rating (1–5).                            |
  | challengesEncountered          | string | Challenges encountered (nullable).                                |
  | challengesAddressed            | string | How challenges were addressed (nullable).                         |
  | lessonsLearned                 | string | Lessons learned (nullable).                                       |
  | budgetAllocated                | string | Budget allocated (nullable).                                      |
  | budgetUtilized                 | string | Budget utilized (nullable).                                       |
  | wereResourcesAdequate          | string | Whether resources were adequate (nullable).                       |
  | inadequateResourcesExplanation | string | Explanation if resources were inadequate (nullable).              |
  | overallSuccess                 | string | Overall success assessment (nullable).                            |
  | recommendTheProgram            | string | Whether the evaluator recommends the programme (nullable).        |
  | improvementSuggestions         | string | Suggestions for improvement (nullable).                           |
  | recommendFuturePrograms        | string | Recommended future programmes (nullable).                         |
  | name                           | string | Name of the evaluator.                                            |
  | role                           | string | Role of the evaluator.                                            |
  | dateSubmitted                  | string | Date of submission (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                                |
  | updatedAt                      | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                     |
  | createdAt                      | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                            |
  | deletedAt                      | string | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                        |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                 |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `read` permission.              |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                 |
}
